# PC card pc-melee-power (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, firepower, BENCH-117): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds (3191-3196, after the bank card's 3183-3190), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: powerprep writes work/melee-power-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, pf, po); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
6
--seed-base
3190
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.Hadur_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur2.Hadur @V@@A@
--out
work/melee-power-@V@-@A@
--report
../docs/bench/local/melee-power-@A@.md
